The enclosure_pmi.* files in this directory are made from text-to-cad's electronics enclosure
base, `models/examples/src/electronics_enclosure_base.py`
(https://github.com/earthtojake/text-to-cad, as it stands on the branch of
earthtojake/text-to-cad#674: amywork777/text-to-cad-upstream, commit
85d8fdbfb467ebd7e22994fe8bcd86afa6626ed3), exported to STEP with build123d. The old revision is
that part with Specify PMI. The new revision (the four mounting holes opened from Ø3 to Ø3.4
and a Ø8 cable entry added in the +X wall) and the PMI on both were made for Specify, from that
base, by its maintainer. text-to-cad's part is used under its MIT licence:

